<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>MHTR legal zones (2023), reconstructed</name><description>Reconstructed from Rajasthan Forest Department map files for reference. Not a legal or cadastral boundary: the reserve is defined by the schedules and boundary descriptions in the notifications. The Forest Department marks its files as for management use, not legal purposes. Built 2026-10-23 by mhtr.in; https://mhtr.in/gis-maps/</description><Folder><name>Reserve outer boundary (2023 extent, as far as public files draw it)</name><Placemark><name>Reserve outer boundary (2023 extent, as far as public files draw it)</name><description>Official files joined; about 182 km² of the notified reserve has no public map and is not included. Union of the Forest Department's reserve file (2013 extent), its national park and sanctuary files, the Bhainsrorgarh WLS file and the whole 2023 buffer blocks drawn in the Kota district file. Holes under 0.01 km² that only appear where two files' edges miss each other are filled.</description><Style><LineStyle><color>ff1f5f2e</color><width>3</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>401f8a5c</color></PolyStyle></Style><ExtendedData><Data name="layer"><value>outer-boundary</value></Data><Data name="name"><value>Reserve outer boundary (2023 extent, as far as public files draw it)</value></Data><Data name="measured_area_km2_wgs84"><value>960.75</value></Data><Data name="notified_area_km2"><value>1135.787</value></Data><Data name="reliability"><value>Official files joined; about 182 km² of the notified reserve has no public map and is not included.</value></Data><Data name="method"><value>Union of the Forest Department's reserve file (2013 extent), its national park and sanctuary files, the Bhainsrorgarh WLS file and the whole 2023 buffer blocks drawn in the Kota district file. Holes under 0.01 km² that only appear where two files' edges miss each other are filled.</value></Data><Data name="instrument"><value>Rajasthan Forest Depart