zones, which also take in most of the village enclaves inside Bhainsrorgarh and part of the unmapped 2023 buffer. Some 2023 additions near Kota and in Bundi may still fall outside. Reserve outer boundary joined with the MHTR ESZ outer-limit file and the Bhainsrorgarh ESZ file. Holes the official files draw are kept (the 3.5 km² exclusion in the MHTR ESZ file); gaps under 0.5 km² where two files' edges miss each other are filled.</description><Style><LineStyle><color>ff3c3c3c</color><width>2</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>00000000</color></PolyStyle></Style><ExtendedData><Data name="layer"><value>outer-boundary-with-esz</value></Data><Data name="name"><value>Reserve and eco-sensitive zones, outer boundary</value></Data><Data name="measured_area_km2_wgs84"><value>1514.62</value></Data><Data name="reliability"><value>Official files joined. Covers the reserve outline above plus both notified eco-sensitive zones, which also take in most of the village enclaves inside Bhainsrorgarh and part of the unmapped 2023 buffer. Some 2023 additions near Kota and in Bundi may still fall outside.</value></Data><Data name="method"><value>Reserve outer boundary joined with the MHTR ESZ outer-limit file and the Bhainsrorgarh ESZ file. Holes the official files draw are kept (the 3.5 km² exclusion in the MHTR ESZ file); gaps under 0.5 km² where two files' edges miss each other are filled.</value></Data><Data name="instrument"><value>Rajasthan Forest Department notification F.3(8)Forest/2012, 9 Apr 2013; Rajasthan Forest Department notification F.3(22)Forest/2023, 5 Oct 2023; MoEFCC S.O. 4268(E), 25 Nov 2020; MoEFCC S.O. 3683(E), 10 Sep 2021</value></Data><Data name="source_files"><value>Forest Department file 'Mukundara Tiger Reserve.kmz' (Tiger Reserve boundary); listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2025-02-24; SHA-256 ec3c6d02c14a… | Forest Department file 'Mukundara Hills National Park.kmz'; listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2018-08-07; SHA-256 a23ca5b24f00… | Forest Departmen