Fs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/ESZ/MHTR.kmz | https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/ESZ/BHAINSROAD%20ESZ.kmz | https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/update/kota/KOTA.kmz</value></Data><Data name="built"><value>2026-10-23</value></Data><Data name="disclaimer"><value>Reconstructed from Rajasthan Forest Department map files for reference. Not a legal or cadastral boundary: the reserve is defined by the schedules and boundary descriptions in the notifications. The Forest Department marks its files as for management use, not legal purposes.</value></Data></ExtendedData><MultiGeometry><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>76.155717,24.818367,0 76.155820,24.817965,0 76.155837,24.817847,0 76.155068,24.817956,0 76.154190,24.818071,0 76.154426,24.817494,0 76.154484,24.817343,0 76.154826,24.817056,0 76.154834,24.817049,0 76.155264,24.816774,0 76.155277,24.816774,0 76.155403,24.816692,0 76.155519,24.816599,0 76.155505,24.816595,0 76.155460,24.816580,0 76.154949,24.816602,0 76.153882,24.816667,0 76.152710,24.816781,0 76.151853,24.816881,0 76.151919,24.817267,0 76.152068,24.818056,0 76.152089,24.818174,0 76.152210,24.818774,0 76.152179,24.818778,0 76.152008,24.818822,0 76.151551,24.818875,0 76.151118,24.818938,0 76.150275,24.819074,0 76.150059,24.819093,0 76.148947,24.818987,0 76.148024,24.818889,0 76.147048,24.818823,0 76.146923,24.819366,0 76.146758,24.820095,0 76.146755,24.820108,0 76.147371,24.820747,0 76.148032,24.820946,0 76.149000,24.821204,0 76.149278,24.821271,0 76.150273,24.821512,0 76.152046,24.821849,0 76.152694,24.821967,0 76.152924,24.822001,0 76.153633,24.822253,0 76.154377,24.822493,0 76.155044,24.822719,0 76.155759,24.822944,0 76.156