sses the 7.75 km² National Chambal core part.</value></Data><Data name="method"><value>National park, Darrah and Jawahar Sagar files merged and clipped to the reserve file.</value></Data><Data name="instrument"><value>Rajasthan Forest Department notification F.3(8)Forest/2012, 9 Apr 2013</value></Data><Data name="source_files"><value>Forest Department file 'Mukundara Tiger Reserve.kmz' (Tiger Reserve boundary); listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2025-02-24; SHA-256 ec3c6d02c14a… | Forest Department file 'Mukundara Hills National Park.kmz'; listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2018-08-07; SHA-256 a23ca5b24f00… | Forest Department file 'Darrah Wildlife Sanctuary.kmz'; listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2018-08-07; SHA-256 cf25d680f872… | Forest Department file 'Jawahar Sagar Wildlife Sanctuary.kmz'; listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2018-08-07; SHA-256 ab6e078d52aa…</value></Data><Data name="source_urls"><value>https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/tigerreserve/Mukundara%20Tiger%20Reserve.kmz | https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/update/wildlife/Mukundara%20Hills%20National%20Park.kmz | https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/update/wildlife/Darrah%20Wildlife%20Sanctuary.kmz | https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/update/wildlife/Jawahar%20Sagar%20Wildlife%20Sanctuary.kmz</value></Data><Data name="built"><value>2026-10-23</value></Data><Data name="disclaimer"><value>Reconstructed from Rajasthan Forest Department map files for reference. Not a legal or