tyle><color>60a6c38c</color></PolyStyle></Style><ExtendedData><Data name="layer"><value>buffer-added-2023-mapped</value></Data><Data name="name"><value>Buffer added 2023: whole blocks a public file draws</value></Data><Data name="measured_area_km2_wgs84"><value>0.92</value></Data><Data name="notified_area_km2"><value>102.25</value></Data><Data name="reliability"><value>Only the three blocks the notification adds whole (Barkheda, Rawtha, Borabas-B; 2.74 km² notified), and most of that already lies inside the reserve file. The file draws Borabas-B at 0.50 km² against 1.38 km² notified. Part-blocks, compartments, the Bundi additions and the National Chambal piece have no public map.</value></Data><Data name="method"><value>Matching blocks from the Kota district forest-block file, minus land already in the reserve file.</value></Data><Data name="instrument"><value>Rajasthan Forest Department notification F.3(22)Forest/2023, 5 Oct 2023</value></Data><Data name="source_files"><value>Forest Department file 'KOTA.kmz' (Kota district forest blocks); listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2018-08-07; SHA-256 f27d048338dc…</value></Data><Data name="source_urls"><value>https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/update/kota/KOTA.kmz</value></Data><Data name="built"><value>2026-10-23</value></Data><Data name="disclaimer"><value>Reconstructed from Rajasthan Forest Department map files for reference. Not a legal or cadastral boundary: the reserve is defined by the schedules and boundary descriptions in the notifications. The Forest Department marks its files as for management use, not legal purposes.</value></Data></ExtendedData><MultiGeometry><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>76.157157,24.819515,0 76.156198,24.819390,0 76.155509,24.819289,0 76.155561,24.819067,0 76.155633,24.818720,0 76.155717,24.818367,0 76.155820,24.817965,0 76.155837,24.817